WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.774
In Microsoft Fabric a common workflow uses a
Lakehouse a notebook Spark SQL and Delta

00:00:05.787 --> 00:00:11.564
tables You might upload or connect files read them
with Spark create

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:18.680
temporary views transform data using SQL and save
curated results as tables The

00:00:18.694 --> 00:00:23.154
same relational ideas still apply but the
environment is lakehouse-oriented
